# 📱 Mobile Signup Flow - UI/UX Design

This project showcases a clean and user-friendly **Mobile Signup Flow** designed as part of the **CODSOFT UI/UX Internship**.

---

## 🧩 Project Overview

The goal of this task was to design a smooth and intuitive signup experience for a mobile application. The flow includes:
- Welcome screen
- Sign-up screen
- Email/phone input
- Password creation
- OTP verification
- Success screen

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used
- Figma  
- Google Fonts  
- Material Design Guidelines  

